      "statement": "pnpm run-local is the one-command local stack: it installs dependencies, builds only typed-storage (imported via its dist) and the frontend asset bundle, and starts wrangler serving the built SPA from the backend at localhost:8787, with data kept in a local .wrangler directory and the run explicitly not production tooling.",
